---
// AboutSection.astro - Target for sidebar & header item "About" (#about)
import { ExternalLink, Quote } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-28 relative -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 lg:-mx-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-t border-white/10">
  <!-- Container Intersection Crosshairs '+' -->
  <div class="absolute -top-2.5 -left-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-white/30 pointer-events-none select-none z-20 hidden sm:block">+</div>
  <div class="absolute -top-2.5 -right-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-white/30 pointer-events-none select-none z-20 hidden sm:block">+</div>

  <div class="mb-12 sm:mb-16">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#ff8600]/10 border border-[#ff8600]/25 text-xs font-mono text-[#ff8600] mb-3">
      <span>06 // PROFILE & PHILOSOPHY</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
      About <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff8600] to-[#ffa033] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Mafly</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-xl">
      Engineering resilient software systems, open-source utilities, and performant backend architectures.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Bio Card (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-white/10 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[#141724] border border-[#ff8600]/50 flex items-center justify-center p-2 relative overflow-hidden">
          <img 
            src="https://assets.viidev.my.id/images/logo/main.png" 
            alt="Mafly Logo" 
            class="w-full h-full object-contain rounded-xl"
          />
          <span class="absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 border-2 border-[#141724]"></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Mafly</h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#ff8600]">Software Developer & Systems Engineer</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Nekoplii" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5 font-mono">
            <span>github.com/Nekoplii</span>
            <ExternalLink class="w-3 h-3 text-[#ff8600]" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I develop systems across web platforms, desktop environments, and server infrastructure. My engineering focus centers on crafting functional, high-reliability software, managing backend infrastructure, and contributing to open-source ecosystems.
        </p>
        <p>
          From low-latency web interfaces built with <span class="text-white font-medium">Astro</span> and <span class="text-white font-medium">TailwindCSS</span> to backend automation and distributed servers, I prioritize simplicity, predictable performance, and maintainable system architecture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Pillars -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#ff8600] font-bold block mb-1">01. RELIABILITY</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Robust error-handling & resilient Linux server operations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#ff8600] font-bold block mb-1">02. PERFORMANCE</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Lightweight execution footprints with minimal runtime overhead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#ff8600] font-bold block mb-1">03. OPEN SOURCE</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Transparent development & reusable software modules.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Tech Setup & Quick Spec (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Work Setup Bento Card -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-white/10">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#ff8600] font-bold mb-4">Environment & Tooling</h4>
        
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs font-mono">
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-white/5 text-slate-400">
            <span>Primary OS</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">Linux / Arch & Ubuntu Server</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-white/5 text-slate-400">
            <span>Core Languages</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">TypeScript, Go, Rust, Bash</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-white/5 text-slate-400">
            <span>Web Stack</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">Astro, TailwindCSS, React</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-white/5 text-slate-400">
            <span>Infrastructure</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">Docker, Nginx, Systemd, Redis</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2 text-slate-400">
            <span>Source Code</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/Nekoplii" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#ff8600] hover:underline">github.com/Nekoplii</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Philosophy Card -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#ff8600]/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#12141e] to-[#1a171f]">
        <Quote class="w-8 h-8 text-[#ff8600] mb-3 opacity-60" />
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 italic leading-relaxed">
          "Build systems that are obvious in design, reliable under load, and respectful of the resources they consume."
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
